  "notes": "Chart note: actual load = rated minus hooks, hangers and hoist rope. 360° is NOT explicitly stated on the chart; brochure text says the 6.7 m track gauge ensures stability within 360° rotation. Printed chart has a small non-monotonic step for 71 m boom (8.6 t at 54 m, 8.7 t at 56 m) - kept as printed. 23 boom columns (20-86 m); 12 selected. Older (2016) brochure; SCC2600A later versions may differ. groundPressure 0.14 MPa. Dims: track length 9145 (tumbler 8003), shoe 1200, width 7980 over tracks (10000 overall incl. frame ends), gauge 6.7 m per text. Track assembly height 1.40 m. Tail swing and boom pivot not dimensioned."
